&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;漏桶 / 令牌桶
&lt;img src=&#34;https://Jul1en-Lin.github.io/p/sentinel/assets/leaky-bucket_hu_b3b917244ed4fa62.webp&#34; width=&#34;1600&#34; height=&#34;1200&#34; srcset=&#34;https://Jul1en-Lin.github.io/p/sentinel/assets/leaky-bucket_hu_667594ffb5a6ad5.webp 800w, https://Jul1en-Lin.github.io/p/sentinel/assets/leaky-bucket_hu_b3b917244ed4fa62.webp 1600w, https://Jul1en-Lin.github.io/p/sentinel/assets/leaky-bucket_hu_e8fce4282e0a09a3.webp 2400w&#34; sizes=&#34;(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1060px&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34; alt=&#34;漏桶算法&#34; class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; data-flex-grow=&#34;133&#34; data-flex-basis=&#34;320px&#34;&gt;
